{
  "$format": "janus-conformance-case/1",
  "id": "facade/pact-js-message-consumer-pact",
  "category": "facade",
  "facade": "pact-js",
  "title": "MessageConsumerPact's message is handed to its handler as pact-js hands it, and recorded when the handler resolves.",
  "covers": [],
  "rows": [
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`MessageConsumerPact`: `given`, `expectsToReceive`, `withContent`, `withTextContent`, `withMetadata`, `verify(handler)`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`withContent(contentType, buffer)` on a message, `MessageConsumerPact`'s `withBinaryContent`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`synchronousBodyHandler`, `asynchronousBodyHandler`, `v4SynchronousBodyHandler`, `v4AsynchronousBodyHandler`"
    }
  ],
  "why": "consumer-test-migration.md, pact-js: `MessageConsumerPact`'s calls are kept, a V3 message pact's; the handler is handed `{ description, providerStates, contents, metadata }`, and the contract is written when it resolves; `withBinaryContent` hands the octets as a `Buffer`.",
  "subjects": { "typescript": "pact-js-message-consumer-pact.ts" },
  "expect": {
    "tests": [{ "test": "jsonContent" }, { "test": "textContent" }, { "test": "binaryContent" }],
    "contracts": {
      "web-app-orders-api.janus.json": {
        "content": {
          "interactions": [
            {
              "description": "an order cancelled message",
              "states": [{ "name": "an order was cancelled", "params": { "id": 3 } }],
              "parts": {
                "message": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "id": { "example": 3, "shape": "equality" },
                      "reason": { "example": "out of stock", "shape": "equality" }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "members": {
                      "queue": { "example": "orders", "shape": "equality" },
                      "contentType": {
                        "of": {
                          "example": "application/json",
                          "pattern": "^\\s*(?i:application)/(?:[^;]*\\+)?(?i:json)\\s*(?:;.*)?$",
                          "shape": "regex"
                        },
                        "shape": "optional"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "an order label message",
              "parts": {
                "message": {
                  "body": { "encoded": "base64", "example": "AQID", "shape": "equality" },
                  "metadata": {
                    "members": {
                      "contentType": {
                        "of": {
                          "example": "application/octet-stream",
                          "pattern": "^\\s*(?i:application)/(?:[^;]*\\+)?(?i:octet\\-stream)\\s*(?:;.*)?$",
                          "shape": "regex"
                        },
                        "shape": "optional"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "an order note message",
              "states": [{ "name": "an order was noted" }],
              "parts": {
                "message": {
                  "body": { "example": "call before delivery", "shape": "equality" },
                  "metadata": {
                    "members": {
                      "contentType": {
                        "of": {
                          "example": "text/plain",
                          "pattern": "^\\s*(?i:text)/(?:[^;]*\\+)?(?i:plain)\\s*(?:;.*)?$",
                          "shape": "regex"
                        },
                        "shape": "optional"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
